{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-86656","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-120070","text":"Weave — a static cost certificate for the [&] stack's resource rung"}]},{"id":"blk-86657","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120071","text":"A research prototype, built invariant-first: find the invariants, state the rules, enforce them in code, close the loop. Plain Node (v18+), no dependencies. Run any script with "},{"id":"spn-120072","marks":["code"],"text":"node <path>"},{"id":"spn-120073","text":" (e.g. "},{"id":"spn-120074","marks":["code"],"text":"node src/weave.mjs"},{"id":"spn-120075","text":"), or use the npm scripts: "},{"id":"spn-120076","marks":["code"],"text":"npm run demo"},{"id":"spn-120077","text":", "},{"id":"spn-120078","marks":["code"],"text":"npm test"},{"id":"spn-120079","text":", "},{"id":"spn-120080","marks":["code"],"text":"npm run proofs"},{"id":"spn-120081","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-86658","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120082","marks":["bold"],"text":"Positioning (read `weave-and-the-ampersand-stack.md` first)."},{"id":"spn-120083","text":" Weave began as \"a better Bend/HVM,\" but with box-and-box and OpenSentience in frame that framing is wrong. Weave is "},{"id":"spn-120084","marks":["italic"],"text":"not"},{"id":"spn-120085","text":" a Bend/HVM competitor — it is a deep probe of one rung of the [&] stack: the "},{"id":"spn-120086","marks":["bold"],"text":"resource rung"},{"id":"spn-120087","text":" (the affine ledger, \"can we afford it\"), and specifically the piece box-and-box doesn't yet have — a "},{"id":"spn-120088","marks":["bold"],"text":"static cost certificate"},{"id":"spn-120089","text":" computed before a computation runs, not a runtime meter read after. HVM4 (now on GitHub in early preview) is the intended execution backend; the cost certificate is substrate-independent, so lowering to HVM4 is an execution choice, not a correctness dependency."}]},{"id":"blk-86659","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-120090","text":"New here? Check the proof, don't take my word for it"}]},{"id":"blk-86660","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120091","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"./proofs/"}],"text":"`proofs/`"},{"id":"spn-120092","text":" holds "},{"id":"spn-120093","marks":["bold"],"text":"proof you can verify without running anything"},{"id":"spn-120094","text":" from committed text — no install, no run. Read "},{"id":"spn-120095","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"./proofs/README.md"}],"text":"`proofs/README.md`"},{"id":"spn-120096","text":", then eyeball "},{"id":"spn-120097","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"./proofs/RECEIPTS.txt"}],"text":"`proofs/RECEIPTS.txt`"},{"id":"spn-120098","text":" (the static cost grade vs. measured growth, checkable by finite differences; the falsifiable soundness predicate; a cross-check against the independent HVM4 runtime) and "},{"id":"spn-120099","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"./proofs/transcripts/"}],"text":"`proofs/transcripts/`"},{"id":"spn-120100","text":" (the exact stdout of every script, claim-by-claim). Regenerate with "},{"id":"spn-120101","marks":["code"],"text":"node proofs/generate.mjs"},{"id":"spn-120102","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-120103","marks":["code"],"text":"node tools/regenerate-proofs.mjs"},{"id":"spn-120104","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-86661","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-120105","text":"Layout"}]},{"id":"blk-86662","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"weave/\n  README.md                            this file\n  proofs/     RECEIPTS.txt (by-hand-checkable) + transcripts/ (per-script) + generate.mjs + README.md\n  src/        the engine (pure library, exports an API; each runs a demo when invoked directly)\n  test/       the validation suites (differential / property / soundness / cross-engine)\n  surface/    weave_surface.exs        the Elixir macro front-end\n  tools/      regenerate-proofs.mjs    rebuilds proofs/transcripts/ (--check verifies no drift)\n  docs/        positioning + design docs"},{"id":"blk-86663","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-120106","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/"},{"id":"spn-120107","text":" — read these first"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-86665","spans":[{"id":"spn-120108","text":"File"}]},{"id":"blk-86666","spans":[{"id":"spn-120109","text":"What it is"}]}],"id":"blk-86664","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-86667","spans":[{"id":"spn-120110","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/weave-and-the-ampersand-stack.md"}]},{"id":"blk-86668","spans":[{"id":"spn-120111","marks":["bold"],"text":"Start here."},{"id":"spn-120112","text":" Repositions Weave inside the [&] stack, grades the stack against the AIOS agent-OS reference (gap analysis), and specifies the cost-certificate → resource-rung integration and the HVM4 backend plan."}]}],[{"id":"blk-86669","spans":[{"id":"spn-120113","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/weave-design.md"}]},{"id":"blk-86670","spans":[{"id":"spn-120114","text":"The design doc: thesis, openings in Bend, the five invariants, the closed loop. "},{"id":"spn-120115","marks":["bold"],"text":"Read after the positioning doc — it predates the [&]-stack reframe and the validation work, so treat it as the starting hypothesis."}]}]]},{"id":"blk-86671","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-120116","marks":["code"],"text":"src/"},{"id":"spn-120117","text":" — the engine"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-86673","spans":[{"id":"spn-120118","text":"File"}]},{"id":"blk-86674","spans":[{"id":"spn-120119","text":"What it is"}]},{"id":"blk-86675","spans":[{"id":"spn-120120","text":"Run"}]}],"id":"blk-86672","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-86676","spans":[{"id":"spn-120121","marks":["code"],"text":"src/weave.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-86677","spans":[{"id":"spn-120122","text":"The core. An Interaction-Calculus reducer (β + sup/dup, metered, with time and space vetoes), the static invariant checker (affine / label-coherence / κ), and a small superposed-search + evolution loop."}]},{"id":"blk-86678","spans":[{"id":"spn-120123","marks":["code"],"text":"node src/weave.mjs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-86679","spans":[{"id":"spn-120124","marks":["code"],"text":"src/weave-classify.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-86680","spans":[{"id":"spn-120125","text":"Cost as a type, statically. Infers types, reports the iteration "},{"id":"spn-120126","marks":["italic"],"text":"rank"},{"id":"spn-120127","text":" (poly / exp / tower) with no execution, and cross-checks against measured cost."}]},{"id":"blk-86681","spans":[{"id":"spn-120128","marks":["code"],"text":"node src/weave-classify.mjs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-86682","spans":[{"id":"spn-120129","marks":["code"],"text":"src/weave-eal.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-86683","spans":[{"id":"spn-120130","marks":["bold"],"text":"The certificate."},{"id":"spn-120131","text":" Type-directed EAL box-decoration: the static box-nesting "},{"id":"spn-120132","marks":["italic"],"text":"depth"},{"id":"spn-120133","text":" (= certified elementary tower height) with a per-binder certificate. Upgrades the rank proxy toward a real bound."}]},{"id":"blk-86684","spans":[{"id":"spn-120134","marks":["code"],"text":"node src/weave-eal.mjs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-86685","spans":[{"id":"spn-120135","marks":["code"],"text":"src/weave-eal-degree.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-86686","spans":[{"id":"spn-120136","text":"Stage B: recovers the polynomial "},{"id":"spn-120137","marks":["italic"],"text":"degree"},{"id":"spn-120138","text":" inside the depth-1 rung by finite differences — the measured ground truth that static LAL (Baillot–Terui) would prove."}]},{"id":"blk-86687","spans":[{"id":"spn-120139","marks":["code"],"text":"node src/weave-eal-degree.mjs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-86688","spans":[{"id":"spn-120140","marks":["code"],"text":"src/weave-cost.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-86689","spans":[{"id":"spn-120141","text":"The cost cliff, measured: addition (linear), multiplication (polynomial), exponentiation towers (detonate). Shows source size ≠ cost."}]},{"id":"blk-86690","spans":[{"id":"spn-120142","marks":["code"],"text":"node src/weave-cost.mjs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-86691","spans":[{"id":"spn-120143","marks":["code"],"text":"src/weave-hvm4.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-86692","spans":[{"id":"spn-120144","text":"Local round-trip lowering to a generic HVM-core syntax + inverse parser (semantics-preserving validation, no external binary)."}]},{"id":"blk-86693","spans":[{"id":"spn-120145","marks":["code"],"text":"node src/weave-hvm4.mjs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-86694","spans":[{"id":"spn-120146","marks":["code"],"text":"src/weave-backend.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-86695","spans":[{"id":"spn-120147","text":"The \"backend\" the surface lowers to (the Nx/EXLA role): reads an IR term as JSON and runs the real engine."}]},{"id":"blk-86696","spans":[{"id":"spn-120148","marks":["code"],"text":"node src/weave-backend.mjs <op> '<ir-json>'"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-86697","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-120149","marks":["code"],"text":"test/"},{"id":"spn-120150","text":" — the validation suites"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-86699","spans":[{"id":"spn-120151","text":"File"}]},{"id":"blk-86700","spans":[{"id":"spn-120152","text":"What it is"}]},{"id":"blk-86701","spans":[{"id":"spn-120153","text":"Run"}]}],"id":"blk-86698","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-86702","spans":[{"id":"spn-120154","marks":["code"],"text":"test/weave-validate.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-86703","spans":[{"id":"spn-120155","text":"Differential testing: linearize a pure λ-term, reduce with Weave, compare the normal form to a reference normal-order evaluator. "},{"id":"spn-120156","marks":["bold"],"text":"12/12."}]},{"id":"blk-86704","spans":[{"id":"spn-120157","marks":["code"],"text":"node test/weave-validate.mjs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-86705","spans":[{"id":"spn-120158","marks":["code"],"text":"test/weave-proptest.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-86706","spans":[{"id":"spn-120159","text":"Checker-gated property testing over thousands of random simply-typed terms. None mis-evaluated."}]},{"id":"blk-86707","spans":[{"id":"spn-120160","marks":["code"],"text":"node test/weave-proptest.mjs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-86708","spans":[{"id":"spn-120161","marks":["code"],"text":"test/weave-soundness.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-86709","spans":[{"id":"spn-120162","text":"Stress-tests the classifier verdict against measured cost over an adversarial battery + ~2000 random terms. Falsifiable predicate: no rank≤1 term detonated."}]},{"id":"blk-86710","spans":[{"id":"spn-120163","marks":["code"],"text":"node test/weave-soundness.mjs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-86711","spans":[{"id":"spn-120164","marks":["code"],"text":"test/weave-fold-test.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-86712","spans":[{"id":"spn-120165","text":"Differential test for the structural-recursion layer: linearized "},{"id":"spn-120166","marks":["code"],"text":"fold"},{"id":"spn-120167","text":" vs JS ground truth over random lists × {add, mul, sub}. "},{"id":"spn-120168","marks":["bold"],"text":"1200/1200."}]},{"id":"blk-86713","spans":[{"id":"spn-120169","marks":["code"],"text":"node test/weave-fold-test.mjs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-86714","spans":[{"id":"spn-120170","marks":["code"],"text":"test/weave-eal-test.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-86715","spans":[{"id":"spn-120171","text":"Validates the EAL "},{"id":"spn-120172","marks":["bold"],"text":"certificate"},{"id":"spn-120173","text":" against "},{"id":"spn-120174","marks":["italic"],"text":"measured"},{"id":"spn-120175","text":" cost (not the proxy): certified-cheap never detonates, "},{"id":"spn-120176","marks":["code"],"text":"eal:true"},{"id":"spn-120177","text":" reduces oracle-free (no residue), depth matches the validated rank."}]},{"id":"blk-86716","spans":[{"id":"spn-120178","marks":["code"],"text":"node test/weave-eal-test.mjs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-86717","spans":[{"id":"spn-120179","marks":["code"],"text":"test/weave-hvm4-run.mjs"}]},{"id":"blk-86718","spans":[{"id":"spn-120180","text":"The real HVM4 backend: lowers to HVM4 surface syntax, shells to the built binary, and differential-tests integer outputs against the toy reducer. "},{"id":"spn-120181","marks":["bold"],"text":"6/6."},{"id":"spn-120182","text":" Needs "},{"id":"spn-120183","marks":["code"],"text":"~/hvm4/src/hvm"},{"id":"spn-120184","text":" (or "},{"id":"spn-120185","marks":["code"],"text":"HVM4_BIN="},{"id":"spn-120186","text":")."}]},{"id":"blk-86719","spans":[{"id":"spn-120187","marks":["code"],"text":"node test/weave-hvm4-run.mjs"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-86720","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-120188","marks":["code"],"text":"surface/"},{"id":"spn-120189","text":" — the Elixir front-end"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-86722","spans":[{"id":"spn-120190","text":"File"}]},{"id":"blk-86723","spans":[{"id":"spn-120191","text":"What it is"}]},{"id":"blk-86724","spans":[{"id":"spn-120192","text":"Run"}]}],"id":"blk-86721","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-86725","spans":[{"id":"spn-120193","marks":["code"],"text":"surface/weave_surface.exs"}]},{"id":"blk-86726","spans":[{"id":"spn-120194","text":"An Elixir macro surface. "},{"id":"spn-120195","marks":["code"],"text":"defweave"},{"id":"spn-120196","text":" compiles native "},{"id":"spn-120197","marks":["code"],"text":"fn"},{"id":"spn-120198","text":" syntax — integer literals, "},{"id":"spn-120199","marks":["code"],"text":"+"},{"id":"spn-120200","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-120201","marks":["code"],"text":"*"},{"id":"spn-120202","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-120203","marks":["code"],"text":"-"},{"id":"spn-120204","text":", list literals, "},{"id":"spn-120205","marks":["code"],"text":"fold"},{"id":"spn-120206","text":" — into Weave IR at compile time, then shells to "},{"id":"spn-120207","marks":["code"],"text":"../src/weave-backend.mjs"},{"id":"spn-120208","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-86727","spans":[{"id":"spn-120209","marks":["code"],"text":"elixir surface/weave_surface.exs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-86728","spans":[{"id":"spn-120210","marks":["code"],"text":"surface/weave_govern.exs"}]},{"id":"blk-86729","spans":[{"id":"spn-120211","marks":["bold"],"text":"The stack, end to end."},{"id":"spn-120212","text":" Authors four plans with "},{"id":"spn-120213","marks":["code"],"text":"defweave"},{"id":"spn-120214","text":", certifies each one's cost class with "},{"id":"spn-120215","marks":["code"],"text":"Weave.classify"},{"id":"spn-120216","text":" (static — no execution), shells to the box-and-box governance kernel (the highest-utility exponential is "},{"id":"spn-120217","marks":["bold"],"text":"annihilated"},{"id":"spn-120218","text":" "},{"id":"spn-120219","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-120220","text":" by the resource-rung floor), "},{"id":"spn-120221","marks":["bold"],"text":"runs"},{"id":"spn-120222","text":" the polynomial winner to a real answer ("},{"id":"spn-120223","marks":["code"],"text":"210"},{"id":"spn-120224","text":"), then runs the refused tower anyway and watches it "},{"id":"spn-120225","marks":["bold"],"text":"detonate"},{"id":"spn-120226","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-120227","marks":["code"],"text":"over-space"},{"id":"spn-120228","text":") — vindicating the static refusal. Cost is a type, and the type decides."}]},{"id":"blk-86730","spans":[{"id":"spn-120229","marks":["code"],"text":"elixir surface/weave_govern.exs"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-86731","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-120230","text":"Honest status"}]},{"id":"blk-86732","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120231","text":"What runs and is validated:"}]},{"id":"blk-86733","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-86735","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120232","text":"The reducer is sound on every term tested — the 12-term battery plus ~3000 random simply-typed"}]}],"id":"blk-86734","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-86736","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120233","text":"terms plus Church arithmetic. No counterexample found."}]},{"id":"blk-86737","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-86739","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120234","text":"The cost cliff is real and measured; the static classifier predicts it from structure before"}]}],"id":"blk-86738","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-86740","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120235","text":"running, and the prediction matches."}]},{"id":"blk-86741","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-86743","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120236","marks":["bold"],"text":"Recursion fork: decided."},{"id":"spn-120237","text":" The surface offers "},{"id":"spn-120238","marks":["italic"],"text":"structural"},{"id":"spn-120239","text":" recursion (fold over a list),"}]}],"id":"blk-86742","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-86744","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120240","text":"not a general "},{"id":"spn-120241","marks":["code"],"text":"fix"},{"id":"spn-120242","text":". A Church-encoded list is its own right fold, so recursion on the spine is total, has no fixpoint, and stays in the elementary/certified fragment — the feature is also the limit, by design."}]},{"id":"blk-86745","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-86747","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120243","marks":["bold"],"text":"Primitives + a list ADT are in, and the surface is now writable."},{"id":"spn-120244","text":" Native integers and "},{"id":"spn-120245","marks":["code"],"text":"+"},{"id":"spn-120246","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-120247","marks":["code"],"text":"*"},{"id":"spn-120248","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-120249","marks":["code"],"text":"-"}]}],"id":"blk-86746","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-86748","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120250","text":"lower to a strict "},{"id":"spn-120251","marks":["code"],"text":"Op"},{"id":"spn-120252","text":" node (type-order 0, no cost-rank contribution); list literals lower to Church lists; "},{"id":"spn-120253","marks":["code"],"text":"fold"},{"id":"spn-120254","text":" is the list applied. Duplicating an "},{"id":"spn-120255","marks":["code"],"text":"Op"},{"id":"spn-120256","text":"-carrying combiner needed one new rule — "},{"id":"spn-120257","marks":["code"],"text":"OP-SUP"},{"id":"spn-120258","text":", the operator/superposition commutation, exactly parallel to the existing "},{"id":"spn-120259","marks":["code"],"text":"APP-SUP"},{"id":"spn-120260","text":". With it, linearized folds match JS ground truth "},{"id":"spn-120261","marks":["bold"],"text":"1200/1200"},{"id":"spn-120262","text":" over random lists and operators, and "},{"id":"spn-120263","marks":["code"],"text":"sum"},{"id":"spn-120264","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-120265","marks":["code"],"text":"product"},{"id":"spn-120266","text":" over a list literal run end-to-end through Elixir and classify rank-1 polynomial."}]},{"id":"blk-86749","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120267","text":"What is a corrected claim (the validation overturned earlier guesses):"}]},{"id":"blk-86750","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-86752","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120268","text":"An early discussion called Church multiplication the \"oracle boundary.\" That was wrong — it was a"}]}],"id":"blk-86751","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-86753","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120269","text":"missing "},{"id":"spn-120270","marks":["code"],"text":"DUP-APP"},{"id":"spn-120271","text":" commutation rule in the reducer, since fixed. There is no known boundary within the tested fragment."}]},{"id":"blk-86754","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-86756","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120272","text":"The static invariants "},{"id":"spn-120273","marks":["code"],"text":"I1"},{"id":"spn-120274","text":" (affine) + "},{"id":"spn-120275","marks":["code"],"text":"I2"},{"id":"spn-120276","text":" (labels) are "},{"id":"spn-120277","marks":["bold"],"text":"not"},{"id":"spn-120278","text":" sufficient for soundness — a term"}]}],"id":"blk-86755","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-86757","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120279","text":"exists that they accept but a naive reducer mis-evaluates. They are a source-level discipline, not a soundness certificate."}]},{"id":"blk-86758","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120280","text":"What is a heuristic, not a theorem:"}]},{"id":"blk-86759","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-86761","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120281","marks":["code"],"text":"weave-classify"},{"id":"spn-120282","text":" uses STLC type-order as a proxy for the complexity rung. It is principled"}]}],"id":"blk-86760","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-86762","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120283","text":"(higher-order iteration climbs the Grzegorczyk hierarchy) and validated on these families, but it is an under-approximation of full Elementary/Light-Affine inference, reports the ladder "},{"id":"spn-120284","marks":["italic"],"text":"rung"},{"id":"spn-120285","text":" not the polynomial degree, and goes silent on terms that aren't simply-typable."}]},{"id":"blk-86763","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-120286","text":"The thesis, as far as it's earned"}]},{"id":"blk-86764","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120287","text":"The defensible core is substructural: you get a guarantee by removing the structural rule that would let you violate it, so the violation becomes inexpressible. In this style the "},{"id":"spn-120288","marks":["italic"],"text":"safety invariant"},{"id":"spn-120289","text":" and the "},{"id":"spn-120290","marks":["italic"],"text":"cost guarantee"},{"id":"spn-120291","text":" are the same object — linearity-with-stratification simultaneously makes reduction sound, licenses the oracle-free fast path, and grades cost. Two of those faces now have running artifacts (soundness: "},{"id":"spn-120292","marks":["code"],"text":"test/weave-validate"},{"id":"spn-120293","text":"; cost: "},{"id":"spn-120294","marks":["code"],"text":"src/weave-classify"},{"id":"spn-120295","text":"), and all three are exhibited together — checkable by hand — in "},{"id":"spn-120296","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"./proofs/RECEIPTS.txt"}],"text":"`proofs/RECEIPTS.txt`"},{"id":"spn-120297","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-86765","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120298","text":"Placed in the [&] stack, this is the "},{"id":"spn-120299","marks":["bold"],"text":"resource rung"},{"id":"spn-120300","text":" made into a static certificate. box-and-box's resource rung is a "},{"id":"spn-120301","marks":["italic"],"text":"runtime"},{"id":"spn-120302","text":" ledger (\"what was spent\"); Weave is the "},{"id":"spn-120303","marks":["italic"],"text":"static"},{"id":"spn-120304","text":" certificate (\"what can be spent, in what class, with termination guaranteed\"). Wired into "},{"id":"spn-120305","marks":["code"],"text":"govern()"},{"id":"spn-120306","text":", a computation that can't be certified to halt within budget becomes "},{"id":"spn-120307","marks":["code"],"text":"0̄"},{"id":"spn-120308","text":" — annihilated, not down-ranked — the same floor pattern the kernel already uses for forbidden actions. Three of your theses converge here: "},{"id":"spn-120309","marks":["bold"],"text":"symbol-as-system"},{"id":"spn-120310","text":" (the verdict is the arithmetic), "},{"id":"spn-120311","marks":["bold"],"text":"topology-as-warrant"},{"id":"spn-120312","text":" (κ licenses the shape of the reasoning), and "},{"id":"spn-120313","marks":["bold"],"text":"cost-as-certificate"},{"id":"spn-120314","text":" (the discipline that makes the fast path sound is the one that bounds cost). See "},{"id":"spn-120315","marks":["code"],"text":"weave-and-the-ampersand-stack.md"},{"id":"spn-120316","text":" for the full integration and gap analysis."}]},{"id":"blk-86766","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120317","marks":["bold"],"text":"Update — the next step is taken (partway)."},{"id":"spn-120318","text":" "},{"id":"spn-120319","marks":["code"],"text":"src/weave-eal.mjs"},{"id":"spn-120320","text":" now computes a real EAL box-decoration: a static box-nesting "},{"id":"spn-120321","marks":["italic"],"text":"depth"},{"id":"spn-120322","text":" (= certified elementary tower height) with a per-binder certificate, validated against "},{"id":"spn-120323","marks":["italic"],"text":"measured"},{"id":"spn-120324","text":" cost in "},{"id":"spn-120325","marks":["code"],"text":"test/weave-eal-test.mjs"},{"id":"spn-120326","text":" (certified-cheap never detonated; every "},{"id":"spn-120327","marks":["code"],"text":"eal:true"},{"id":"spn-120328","text":" term reduced oracle-free). The depth-1 rung's polynomial "},{"id":"spn-120329","marks":["italic"],"text":"degree"},{"id":"spn-120330","text":" is recovered empirically in "},{"id":"spn-120331","marks":["code"],"text":"src/weave-eal-degree.mjs"},{"id":"spn-120332","text":". And "},{"id":"spn-120333","marks":["code"],"text":"test/weave-hvm4-run.mjs"},{"id":"spn-120334","text":" wires the real HVM4 backend (6/6 differential agreement), confirming the certificate is substrate-independent."}]},{"id":"blk-86767","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-120335","text":"What remains genuinely open: the polynomial "},{"id":"spn-120336","marks":["bold"],"text":"degree"},{"id":"spn-120337","text":" is still "},{"id":"spn-120338","marks":["italic"],"text":"measured"},{"id":"spn-120339","text":", not statically inferred. Pinning it by type is "},{"id":"spn-120340","marks":["bold"],"text":"static LAL"},{"id":"spn-120341","text":" inference (Light Affine Logic / Baillot–Terui §-boxes) — the named boundary. EAL gives the certified "},{"id":"spn-120342","marks":["italic"],"text":"tower height"},{"id":"spn-120343","text":"; LAL would give the certified "},{"id":"spn-120344","marks":["italic"],"text":"degree"},{"id":"spn-120345","text":"."}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaierasof6iphmddm2vyghdz3rczdvqzsbr45bwrdbr3pjwjacir57lcsa","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}